  "01_Project_Planning/Risk_Register.md": {
    "title": "Risk Register",
    "category": "01. Project Planning",
    "categoryId": "01_Project_Planning",
    "fileName": "Risk_Register.md",
    "content": "# Risk Register\n## Proyek: GSI One Mobile Application & Backend Infrastructure\n\n---\n\n## Skala Penilaian\n\n- **Dampak**: 1 (Rendah) - 2 (Sedang) - 3 (Tinggi)\n- **Probabilitas**: 1 (Rendah) - 2 (Sedang) - 3 (Tinggi)\n- **Risk Score** = Dampak x Probabilitas (1-3: Low, 4-6: Medium, 7-9: High)\n\n---\n\n## Daftar Risiko Teridentifikasi & Ter-Audit\n\n| ID    | Kategori     | Deskripsi Risiko                                       | Dampak | Prob. | Score | Status    | Mitigasi Evaluasi Codebase                                      |\n| ----- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------ | ----- | ----- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| R-001 | Teknis       | API backend timeout / kegagalan koneksi DB            | 3      | 2     | 6     | Mitigated | Error handling terpusat di `errorHelpers.ts`, retry logic & fallback lokal |\n| R-002 | Keamanan     | Akses CORS dari domain tidak dikenal / unauthorized     | 3      | 2     | 6     | Mitigated | Whitelist terisolasi di `server.js` (`allowedOrigins`), log audit origin |\n| R-003 | Keamanan     | Header HTTP rentan terhadap serangan XSS/Clickjacking  | 3      | 1     | 3     | Mitigated | Penggunaan `helmet()` middleware & penyembunyian `x-powered-by` |\n| R-004 | Operasional  | `JWT_SECRET` tidak didefinisikan di environment server  | 3      | 1     | 3     | Mitigated | Penghentian fatal server (`process.exit(1)`) jika `JWT_SECRET` belum diset |\n| R-005 | Keamanan     | Akses data antar-role bocor di PostgreSQL              | 3      | 1     | 3     | Mitigated | Row Level Security (RLS) aktif pada 7 tabel Supabase            |\n| R-006 | Operasional  | Inkonsistensi nama klien pada proyek & profil          | 2      | 2     | 4     | Mitigated | Trigger otomatis `sync_user_name_changes` di PostgreSQL         |\n| R-007 | Teknis       | Upload file berukuran besar melampaui batas server      | 2      | 2     | 4     | Mitigated | Batas `express.json({ limit: '10mb' })` & validasi Multer       |\n| R-008 | Bisnis       | Lambatnya respons tindak lanjut booking survei         | 2      | 2     | 4     | Mitigated | Fitur klaim status booking (`claimed`) oleh Marketing & Admin   |\n",
    "contentHtml": "<h1>Risk Register</h1>\n<h2>Proyek: GSI One Mobile Application &amp; Backend Infrastructure</h2>\n<hr />\n<h2>Skala Penilaian</h2>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Dampak</strong>: 1 (Rendah) - 2 (Sedang) - 3 (Tinggi)</li>\n  <li><strong>Probabilitas</strong>: 1 (Rendah) - 2 (Sedang) - 3 (Tinggi)</li>\n  <li><strong>Risk Score</strong> = Dampak x Probabilitas (1-3: Low, 4-6: Medium, 7-9: High)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Daftar Risiko Teridentifikasi &amp; Ter-Audit</h2>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>ID</th>\n      <th>Kategori</th>\n      <th>Deskripsi Risiko</th>\n      <th>Dampak</th>\n      <th>Prob.</th>\n      <th>Score</th>\n      <th>Status</th>\n      <th>Mitigasi Evaluasi Codebase</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-001</td>\n      <td>Teknis</td>\n      <td>API backend timeout / kegagalan koneksi DB</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>6</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Error handling terpusat di <code>errorHelpers.ts</code>, retry logic &amp; fallback lokal</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-002</td>\n      <td>Keamanan</td>\n      <td>Akses CORS dari domain tidak dikenal / unauthorized</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>6</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Whitelist terisolasi di <code>server.js</code> (<code>allowedOrigins</code>), log audit origin</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-003</td>\n      <td>Keamanan</td>\n      <td>Header HTTP rentan terhadap serangan XSS/Clickjacking</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Penggunaan <code>helmet()</code> middleware &amp; penyembunyian <code>x-powered-by</code></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-004</td>\n      <td>Operasional</td>\n      <td><code>JWT_SECRET</code> tidak didefinisikan di environment server</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Penghentian fatal server (<code>process.exit(1)</code>) jika <code>JWT_SECRET</code> belum diset</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-005</td>\n      <td>Keamanan</td>\n      <td>Akses data antar-role bocor di PostgreSQL</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Row Level Security (RLS) aktif pada 7 tabel Supabase</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-006</td>\n      <td>Operasional</td>\n      <td>Inkonsistensi nama klien pada proyek &amp; profil</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Trigger otomatis <code>sync<em>user</em>name_changes</code> di PostgreSQL</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-007</td>\n      <td>Teknis</td>\n      <td>Upload file berukuran besar melampaui batas server</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Batas <code>express.json({ limit: '10mb' })</code> &amp; validasi Multer</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>R-008</td>\n      <td>Bisnis</td>\n      <td>Lambatnya respons tindak lanjut booking survei</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>Mitigated</td>\n      <td>Fitur klaim status booking (<code>claimed</code>) oleh Marketing &amp; Admin</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n"
  },
