    "fileName": "Version_History.md",
    "content": "# Version History\n## Proyek: GSI One Mobile Application & Backend Infrastructure\n\n---\n\n## Riwayat Versi & Pembaruan Codebase\n\n| Versi | Tanggal Rilis | Tipe Rilis | Ringkasan Perubahan Utama |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **v3.0.0** | 31 Juli 2026 | Major | Audit keamanan CORS & Helmet, pembaruan dokumentasi 12 folder, penambahan tabel ISO 25010 & RBAC, regenerasi HTML Viewer |\n| **v2.1.0** | 28 Juli 2026 | Minor | Sinkronisasi dokumentasi SDLC 100%, reorganisasi Clean Architecture 5-layer (skor Maintainability A), pipeline Survey Request lengkap |\n| **v2.0.0** | 15 Juni 2026 | Major | Migrasi ke Supabase PostgreSQL RLS, Multi-Role Dashboard (Admin, Marketing, Engineer, Client), Admin-Only Registration |\n| **v1.0.0** | 13 Mei 2026 | Major | MVP Alpha - Katalog Layanan, Booking Survei, Tracking Proyek dasar, Autentikasi JWT |\n\n---\n\n## Detail Perubahan per Versi\n\n### v3.0.0 (31 Juli 2026) - Security Audit & Documentation Overhaul\n\n| Kategori | Perubahan |\n| --- | --- |\n| Keamanan | Audit CORS whitelist enforcement di `server.js` (3 origin terdaftar) |\n| Keamanan | Integrasi `helmet()` untuk HTTP security headers |\n| Keamanan | Validasi fatal `JWT_SECRET` pada startup backend server |\n| Dokumentasi | Pembaruan 12 folder docs dengan tabel RACI, RBAC, RTM, ISO 25010, SLO, Test Cases |\n| Dokumentasi | Regenerasi `docs_data.js` dan seluruh file `.html` Viewer |\n\n### v2.1.0 (28 Juli 2026) - SDLC Documentation Sync & Refactoring\n\n| Kategori | Perubahan |\n| --- | --- |\n| Arsitektur | Reorganisasi ke Clean Architecture 5-layer |\n| Repository | Sub-repository facade (Query, Stage, File, Command) |\n| Testing | Baseline 15 suite, 74 tests (termasuk integration, pagination, RLS, storage) |\n| Pipeline | Alur Survey Request lengkap: klaim, approval, rejection, konversi ke proyek |\n\n### v2.0.0 (15 Juni 2026) - Multi-Role & Supabase RLS Migration\n\n| Kategori | Perubahan |\n| --- | --- |\n| Database | Migrasi dari SQLite-only ke Supabase PostgreSQL Cloud dengan RLS |\n| Auth | Admin-Only Registration via `AdminRegisterModal` |\n| Frontend | Multi-Role Dashboard (Admin, Marketing, Engineer, Client) |\n| Type Safety | Penambahan `database.types.ts` untuk strict typing Supabase rows |\n\n### v1.0.0 (13 Mei 2026) - MVP Alpha Release\n\n| Kategori | Perubahan |\n| --- | --- |\n| Frontend | Katalog 6 Layanan, Studi Kasus, Booking Survei |\n| Backend | Express REST API, SQLite database lokal |\n| Auth | Login JWT dasar dengan email/password |\n| Project | Tracking proyek dasar dengan status sederhana |\n",
    "contentHtml": "<h1>Version History</h1>\n<h2>Proyek: GSI One Mobile Application &amp; Backend Infrastructure</h2>\n<hr />\n<h2>Riwayat Versi &amp; Pembaruan Codebase</h2>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Versi</th>\n      <th>Tanggal Rilis</th>\n      <th>Tipe Rilis</th>\n      <th>Ringkasan Perubahan Utama</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>v3.0.0</strong></td>\n      <td>31 Juli 2026</td>\n      <td>Major</td>\n      <td>Audit keamanan CORS &amp; Helmet, pembaruan dokumentasi 12 folder, penambahan tabel ISO 25010 &amp; RBAC, regenerasi HTML Viewer</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>v2.1.0</strong></td>\n      <td>28 Juli 2026</td>\n      <td>Minor</td>\n      <td>Sinkronisasi dokumentasi SDLC 100%, reorganisasi Clean Architecture 5-layer (skor Maintainability A), pipeline Survey Request lengkap</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>v2.0.0</strong></td>\n      <td>15 Juni 2026</td>\n      <td>Major</td>\n      <td>Migrasi ke Supabase PostgreSQL RLS, Multi-Role Dashboard (Admin, Marketing, Engineer, Client), Admin-Only Registration</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>v1.0.0</strong></td>\n      <td>13 Mei 2026</td>\n      <td>Major</td>\n      <td>MVP Alpha - Katalog Layanan, Booking Survei, Tracking Proyek dasar, Autentikasi JWT</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<hr />\n<h2>Detail Perubahan per Versi</h2>\n<h3>v3.0.0 (31 Juli 2026) - Security Audit &amp; Documentation Overhaul</h3>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Kategori</th>\n      <th>Perubahan</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Keamanan</td>\n      <td>Audit CORS whitelist enforcement di <code>server.js</code> (3 origin terdaftar)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Keamanan</td>\n      <td>Integrasi <code>helmet()</code> untuk HTTP security headers</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Keamanan</td>\n      <td>Validasi fatal <code>JWT_SECRET</code> pada startup backend server</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Dokumentasi</td>\n      <td>Pembaruan 12 folder docs dengan tabel RACI, RBAC, RTM, ISO 25010, SLO, Test Cases</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Dokumentasi</td>\n      <td>Regenerasi <code>docs_data.js</code> dan seluruh file <code>.html</code> Viewer</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>v2.1.0 (28 Juli 2026) - SDLC Documentation Sync &amp; Refactoring</h3>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Kategori</th>\n      <th>Perubahan</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Arsitektur</td>\n      <td>Reorganisasi ke Clean Architecture 5-layer</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Repository</td>\n      <td>Sub-repository facade (Query, Stage, File, Command)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Testing</td>\n      <td>Baseline 15 suite, 74 tests (termasuk integration, pagination, RLS, storage)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Pipeline</td>\n      <td>Alur Survey Request lengkap: klaim, approval, rejection, konversi ke proyek</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>v2.0.0 (15 Juni 2026) - Multi-Role &amp; Supabase RLS Migration</h3>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Kategori</th>\n      <th>Perubahan</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Database</td>\n      <td>Migrasi dari SQLite-only ke Supabase PostgreSQL Cloud dengan RLS</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Auth</td>\n      <td>Admin-Only Registration via <code>AdminRegisterModal</code></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Frontend</td>\n      <td>Multi-Role Dashboard (Admin, Marketing, Engineer, Client)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Type Safety</td>\n      <td>Penambahan <code>database.types.ts</code> untuk strict typing Supabase rows</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>v1.0.0 (13 Mei 2026) - MVP Alpha Release</h3>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Kategori</th>\n      <th>Perubahan</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Frontend</td>\n      <td>Katalog 6 Layanan, Studi Kasus, Booking Survei</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Backend</td>\n      <td>Express REST API, SQLite database lokal</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Auth</td>\n      <td>Login JWT dasar dengan email/password</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Project</td>\n      <td>Tracking proyek dasar dengan status sederhana</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n"
